<title>BELGIUM: EU committee raises cane molasses duty.</title>
<headline>EU committee raises cane molasses duty.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday raised the import duty on cane molasses to 0.13 Ecus per 100 kg from 0.04 Ecus per 100 kg, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The tariff was based on a representative price of 8.08 Ecus per 100 kg, down from the previous week's figure of 8.17,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>Duty on beet molasses remains at zero, with a representative price of 11.25 Ecus per 100 kg, compared with the previous week's figure of 11.22 Ecus per 100 kg.</p>
</text>
